# The build context is what the Dockerfile needs: sources, manifests, lockfile, infra/caddy.
# Local installs and build output never go in; the image builds its own.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
.git
.env
.env.*

# Not needed by any image; leaving them out keeps the build cache valid when only they change.
.github
docs
**/*.md
infra/backup
docker-compose*.yml
docker-compose.override.yml.example
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
